@startuml
|Student|
start
:Click on Course;

|System|
:Load Course & Instructor Details;

|Student|
:View Details;
:Click "Enroll in Course";

|System|
:Request Email Address;

|Student|
:Enter Email;

|System|
:Check if Email Exists in DB;

if (Email Exists?) then (No)
  :Inform "No Account Found";
  :Prompt to Create Account;
  |Student|
  :Create Account;
  |System|
  :Account Created;
else (Yes)
endif

|System|
:Load Student & Course Info;
:Compose Email to Admin;
:Send Email to Admin;
:Increment Enrollment Count;
:Create Enrollment Record\n(Student-Course Association);
:Send Confirmation Message to Student;

stop
@enduml
